    "Demographic Transition: Shift to lower birth and death rates due to modernization.",

    "Critique of Marriage: Seen by feminists as a barrier to gender equality.",

    "Contraceptive Revolution: Widespread use of birth control pill empowered women.",

    "Labor Participation: Rise in employed married women from 1960 to 1980.",

